OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry and clear. Then the rest   
OL,7,Fof the night will be dry with lengthy  
OL,8,Fclear periods and a widespread sharp   
OL,9,Ffrost. Perhaps the odd patch of        
OL,10,Ffreezing fog.                          
OL,12,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start all     
OL,13,Fparts will have a dry, cold and sunny  
OL,14,Fday, perhaps an early freezing fog     
OL,15,Fpatch. Light winds in east, turning    
OL,16,Fbreezier in southwest.                 
OL,18,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and 
OL,19,Fsunny on Sunday, overnight frost. Dry  
OL,20,Ffor most of Monday but rain likely to  
OL,21,Fspread from the west by Tuesday.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
